; A %{exe:...} reference to a target of this project. It reaches E941 beside
; %{bin:...} as the bare name "gen", which no package installs, so resolution
; answers nothing for it -- and over a whole-project index that is an answer,
; not an undecided question. Here to hold that: were the gate to treat every
; scan as partial, this run would report a question it can decide.
(executable
 (name gen))

(rule
 (alias check)
 (deps %{exe:gen.exe})
 (action
  (progn)))
